  "Etimad's keyword search is spelling-exact: 'الأثر البيئي' and 'الاثر البيئي' returned different tenders on 7 Oct 2026, so both spellings are listed wherever a hamza or taa marbuta could vary.",
  "Every Arabic keyword search also returns a fixed block of about 24-47 tenders with reference numbers 2000xxxxxx (agencies shown as e.g. '20251231SAUDI IRRIGATION ORGANIZATION'). These are not matches; the capture drops them from keyword results and records them once per week through lane 'block'.",
  "Results are sorted by submission deadline (newest first). Asking for a page past the last one silently returns page 1 again, so the capture stops when a page repeats.",
  "The status filter (TenderCategory) did NOT work through the URL or through the site's own search panel on 7 Oct 2026; open/closed is therefore read from the 'days left' field on each card.",
  "Agency, activity, region and tender-type filters are not yet verified as URL parameters; those lanes are drafts to be tested in Stage 2 before they are relied on."
